{"4127700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hoyito Patá", "steam_appid": 4127700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The summer is over! Not everything is bad, the best part of school is back, the break! Play &quot;nutmeg kick&quot;, or as it is called here, &quot;Hoyito Patá&quot;, with your friends. Kick, eliminate the rest and try to not get your butt kicked in this vibrant arcade game of football from early 2000s in South America.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to six students enter the ring in fast and chaotic matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127700/extras/a99ba76fe5321c40b42f54530a25f1c9.avif?t=1761508377\" width=588 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone starts in a circle, kicking the ball back and forth between random rivals. If you fail to touch the ball, you fall to a nutmeg and you will need to run: everyone else will try to catch you and kick you in the butt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127700/extras/7597951918fd685dc17b4410f2a2ee16.avif?t=1761508377\" width=588 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, avoid and use your special abilities to turn the game around. When you bar goes to zero, you are out... until the next break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127700/extras/7593c8dfacb331d8d3577cdf8cf213d0.avif?t=1761508377\" width=588 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a retro 3D pixel art inspired in the breaks from the early 2000s, Hoyito Patá mixes school humor with classic arcade frenzy. Rugged uniforms, slashed snickers and a ball that roars with each bounce: pure urbane energy with a taste of childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friend, warm those legs and show who is the boss on the schoolyard!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The summer is over! Not everything is bad, the best part of school is back, the break! Play &quot;nutmeg kick&quot;, or as it is called here, &quot;Hoyito Patá&quot;, with your friends. Kick, eliminate the rest and try to not get your butt kicked in this vibrant arcade game of football from early 2000s in South America.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to six students enter the ring in fast and chaotic matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127700/extras/a99ba76fe5321c40b42f54530a25f1c9.avif?t=1761508377\" width=588 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone starts in a circle, kicking the ball back and forth between random rivals. If you fail to touch the ball, you fall to a nutmeg and you will need to run: everyone else will try to catch you and kick you in the butt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127700/extras/7597951918fd685dc17b4410f2a2ee16.avif?t=1761508377\" width=588 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, avoid and use your special abilities to turn the game around. When you bar goes to zero, you are out... until the next break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127700/extras/7593c8dfacb331d8d3577cdf8cf213d0.avif?t=1761508377\" width=588 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_para